{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhen she speaks, Her voice sounds like birdsong\u2026\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Day I Became a Bird is a heartwarming and handcrafted narrative-adventure game. Telling the tender tale of a young boy, Frank, on his fledgling journey of fluttering feelings, innocent self-expression and honest ingenuity. A story of beaks, feathers, and heartfelt birdsong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this playable bedtime story, follow Frank through a slice of his life - biking to school, running around the park, completing puzzles, making memories, and discovering newfound feelings for his classmate, Sylvia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Frank learn more about her, uncover her interests, and ultimately hatch a plan to catch her eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come along for a warm and nostalgic return to childhood, this is one for the hopeful romantics. Let your hearts flutter, spread your wings, and soar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3120030?t=1772035775","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120030/81e37e3d642a734d72955d9020aae8e032d34984/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772035775","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120030/a3ebd1667f087517e75153a9096130f9b9e015e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772035775","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120030/a3ebd1667f087517e75153a9096130f9b9e015e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772035775","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"descrip